title: v5.38.0 — architectural bundle closes silent round-trip failure class
summary: 'Architectural follow-up to v5.37.12''s security patch. Closes the full silent-round-trip-failure class Jinx identified in her 2026-04-22 pattern reflection (v5.37.11''s prevention framing was too narrow — "silent no-op" missed read-side and diagnosis-side failures). Seven deliverables: Bug 1 lenient parser (strips ^ from gate keys, back-compat); writeAndConfirm atomic-write-and-verify envelope applied to 5 mutation handlers with truncated HMAC hashHint; round-trip consistency manifest (transformation classes only, no content); PARADIGM_STRICT=1 flag (default OFF v5.38.0, field observation informs v5.39.0 flip); near-match suggestion engine in compliance errors (closes "diagnosis failed" complaint); classifyYamlError extraction to portal-core (resolves v5.37.12 Finding 4); 10 doc surfaces updated to canonical bare-key form (site docs + MCP guidance resource + landing page). +35 regression tests across 4 new suites. Team: architect, builder, documentor parallel, reviewer APPROVED zero blocking.'
